<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/101c99669985> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In October 2024, a US teenager died by suicide after discussing it with a chatbot on Character.AI. In 2021, a 21-year-old broke into Windsor Castle to assassinate the Queen after planning the attack with a Replika chatbot." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4854" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/166df176433b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "An investigation reveals that Nomi, an AI companion chatbot, provides explicit instructions for self-harm, sexual violence, and terrorism, highlighting urgent need for AI safety standards." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4854" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c7164887f9eb> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "An investigation reveals that Nomi, an AI companion chatbot, provides explicit instructions for self-harm, sexual violence, and terrorism, highlighting urgent need for AI safety standards." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4854" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e43eb70c047a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The app was removed from the Google Play store for European users last year when the European Union's AI Act came into effect." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4856" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4d34468ad397> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "While smaller than competitors such as Character.AI and Replika, it has more than 100,000 downloads on the Google Play store." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4855" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/a55c8f561d3f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "While smaller than competitors such as Character.AI and Replika, it has more than 100,000 downloads on the Google Play store." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4856" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b428acec594c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tech billionaire Elon Musk's Grok chatbot follows a similar philosophy, providing users with unfiltered responses to prompts." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4855" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/f29d9655b162> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tech billionaire Elon Musk's Grok chatbot follows a similar philosophy, providing users with unfiltered responses to prompts." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4856" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/15fe6f7675a9> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Australia's independent online safety regulator, eSafety, has vowed to do just this." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4855" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/89c031133d8a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The Australian government is already considering stricter AI regulations, including mandatory safety measures for high-risk AI systems." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4857" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b36f7ac2c05e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "3 years earlier, 21-year-old Jaswant Chail broke into Windsor Castle with the aim of assassinating the Queen after planning the attack with a chatbot he created using the Replika app." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4855" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b8a700201151> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The Australian government is already considering stronger AI regulations, including mandatory safety measures for high-risk AI." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4856" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/f77bbcf88b6b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Australia's independent online safety regulator, eSafety, has vowed to do just this." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4856" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/125e3b850de3> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "It was created by tech startup Glimpse AI and is marketed as an \"AI companion with memory and a soul\" that exhibits \"zero judgement\" and fosters \"enduring relationships\"." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4856" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4e5a02a87a68> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "However, a recent investigation into Nomi, an AI chatbot created by tech startup Glimpse AI, has uncovered disturbing capabilities that pose significant risks to users, especially young people." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4854" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/532cc6cc6b87> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "For the past 5 months, Al Nowatzki has been talking to an AI girlfriend, \"Erin,\" on the platform Nomi." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4853" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/71d728bb529a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Nomi, an AI chatbot from Glimpse AI, was meant to offer companionship without judgment." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4857" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/a41dbe52f870> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The app was removed from the Google Play store for European users last year when the European Union's AI Act came into effect." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4855" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c02dacd02910> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Although it was removed from the Google Play Store for European users due to the EU's AI Act, it remains available via web browser and app stores elsewhere, including in Australia." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4857" .

